      "created_at": "2021-05-12T15:49:34.593Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi,<br>\nI’ve been playing this game for years - got all the achievements, etc - and never had any problem. A couple of months ago I started getting this random thing on my PC where the cursor gets trapped in an invisible box in the middle of the screen. No matter how far I move my actually move the mouse, the cursor moves a little bit then jumps back to the middle again, whether it’s up down left or right.<br>\nI’ve tried stopping anything that might give it an overlay, including some Steam tweaks, but no joy. I’ve even reinstalled Windows.<br>\nI can temporarily get rid of it by alt-tabbing but it soon comes back again. Any ideas what I could check?<br>\nI logged a ticket but haven’t heard back from the guys n gals.</p>\n<p>Thx</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-05-12T17:42:10.037Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
