      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Hi,\nI've been playing this game for years - got all the achievements, etc - and never had any problem. A couple of months ago I started getting this random thing on my PC where the cursor gets trapped in an invisible box in the middle of the screen. No matter how far I move my actually move the mouse, the cursor moves a little bit then jumps back to the middle again, whether it's up down left or right.\nI've tried stopping anything that might give it an overlay, including some Steam tweaks, but no joy. I've even reinstalled Windows. \nI can temporarily get rid of it by alt-tabbing but it soon comes back again. Any ideas what I could check?\nI logged a ticket but haven't heard back from the guys n gals.\n\nThx",
